flowchart TD
    %% Diagram 3b: Activity - Patient Record Claiming
    %% Based on src/app/(auth)/portal/page.tsx implementation
    %% Phase 2: Claim Patient Record (only for patients redirected to /account)

    Start([Start]) --> A[Call RPC claim_my_patient_record]
    A --> B{Multiple patients<br/>with same email?}

    B -->|Yes| C[Return Error:<br/>Ambiguous Match]
    C --> D([End - Contact Clinic])

    B -->|No| E{Patient record<br/>exists?}

    E -->|No| F[Return Error:<br/>No Match Found]
    F --> G([End - Contact Clinic])

    E -->|Yes| H[Link user to patient<br/>record in database]
    H --> I[Load Patient Dashboard]
    I --> J([End])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px
    style C fill:#fecaca,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    style F fill:#fecaca,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    style H fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:1px